You would walk past [[The Undertable]] a dozen times before noticing it — a narrow seam of a building squeezed between two former homes in [[Star 12]], down the horizon in [[Hallia]], marked only by a handwritten sign and the conspicuous absence of a display window. Inside, the stock tells no particular story: appliances, jewelry, radios in stages of deconstruction, and firearms, all arrayed with the quiet indifference of a pawn shop that has no interest in advertising what it has.
